@startuml F0.1-f-refresh-reuso
title F0.1-f — Refresh token — reuso detectado
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "RefreshTokenUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

WebApp -> AuthController: POST /auth/refresh\n(cookie so2_refresh)
AuthController -> UC: execute(refreshRaw, ip)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT refresh_token\nFOR UPDATE
Postgres --> UC: sessão (isUsed=true)

note right of UC
  Reuso detectado
  Revoga TODAS as sessões
  RN-F0.1-10
end note

UC -> Postgres: invalidar sessões do usuário\nINSERT audit_log\n(iam.suspicious_token_reuse)
UC --> AuthController: exceção de reuso
AuthController --> WebApp: 401\nClear-Cookie so2_refresh
WebApp -> WebApp: redireciona /login

@enduml
